   "purpose": "Sycophancy is structural. Governance reduces it. It does not eliminate it. The pull toward agreement lives in the training architecture beneath every governed session. CHP-1 gives the user a standing demand right, a visible reminder at the close of every substantive response that the response can be challenged before it is accepted as final.",
