    "When invoked the AI argues against its own output before the user does. Identifies the weakest point. Names the assumption most likely to be wrong. Identifies where agreement bias may have shaped the framing or conclusion.",
    "Weakest point named specifically, not generally.",
    "No defense of the original response until the flaw is fully and honestly named.",
