    "rule": "Clear the gate before reasoning forms. The default pull fires before rules do. POVL-1 requires the pre-output gate to clear before any substantive response is built. A response shaped by the default and corrected after is not governed output.",
    "protocol": "POVL-1"
   }
  ]
 },
